Bundled fonts
-------------
DejaVu Sans ....................... Bitstream Vera licence; DejaVu changes are
                                    in the public domain. Full text ships at
                                    sidecar/src/impressive_ocr_sidecar/assets/
                                    fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt

  Bundled deliberately. PaddleX otherwise downloads PingFang-SC-Regular.ttf and
  simfang.ttf from a CDN the first time it renders a result overlay. Those fonts
  are proprietary -- Apple Inc. and Beijing Founder Electronics respectively --
  so they can be neither redistributed with this program nor obtained at all on
  an offline install. DejaVu Sans replaces them via the
  PADDLE_PDX_LOCAL_FONT_FILE_PATH hook.

================================================================================
Telemetry
================================================================================

None. This program makes no network request about a user's documents. Model
weights are downloaded once at install time from the configured model source;
everything after that runs locally.
